 end="00:27.080">keeps </span><span begin="00:27.080" end="00:27.370">me</span><span begin="00:27.370" end="00:28.670"> </span><span begin="00:28.670" end="00:28.930">unhealthy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.960" end="00:43.830"><span begin="00:28.960" end="00:30.022">I</span><span begin="00:30.022" end="00:31.084">, </span><span begin="00:31.084" end="00:32.146">I </span><span begin="00:32.146" end="00:33.208">don't </span><span begin="00:33.208" end="00:34.270">want</span><span begin="00:34.270" end="00:35.332"> </span><span begin="00:35.332" end="00:36.394">to </span><span begin="00:36.394" end="00:37.456">have </span><span begin="00:37.456" end="00:38.518">to </span><span begin="00:38.518" end="00:39.580">think </span><span begin="00:39.580" end="00:40.642"> </span><span begin="00:40.642" end="00:41.704">of </span><span begin="00:41.704" end="00:42.766"> </span><span begin="00:42.766" end="00:43.830">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.830" end="00:50.730"><span begin="00:43.830" end="00:50.730">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.730" end="00:54.870"><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:51.190">Don't</span><span begin="00:51.190" end="00:51.650"> </span><span begin="00:51.650" end="00:52.110">you </span><span begin="00:52.110" end="00:52.570">want </span><span begin="00:52.570" end="00:53.030">to </span><span begin="00:53.030" end="00:53.490">drive </span><span begin="00:53.490" end="00:53.950">into </span><span begin="00:53.950" end="00:54.410">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.870" end="00:58.910"><span begin="00:54.870" end="00:55.060">This </span><span begin="00:55.060" end="00:55.480">time </span><span begin="00:55.480" end="00:55.550">I </span><span begin="00:55.550" end="00:56.290">was </span><span begin="00:56.290" end="00:56.830">still </span><span begin="00:56.830" end="00:57.080">in </span><span begin="00:57.080" end="00:58.530">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.910" end="01:02.470"><span begin="00:58.910" e