 </span><span begin="01:33.870" end="01:34.730">everything </span><span begin="01:34.730" end="01:35.170">of </span><span begin="01:35.170" end="01:35.700">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.700" end="01:40.600"><span begin="01:35.700" end="01:36.740">But</span><span begin="01:36.740" end="01:36.740">, </span><span begin="01:36.740" end="01:37.710">but </span><span begin="01:37.710" end="01:37.800"> </span><span begin="01:37.800" end="01:38.110">you </span><span begin="01:38.110" end="01:38.560">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:38.560" end="01:38.870">steal </span><span begin="01:38.870" end="01:39.220">back </span><span begin="01:39.220" end="01:39.250">a </span><span begin="01:39.250" end="01:39.340">cup </span><span begin="01:39.340" end="01:39.430">of </span><span begin="01:39.430" end="01:39.530">my </span><span begin="01:39.530" end="01:40.600">hearts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.600" end="01:50.270"><span begin="01:40.600" end="01:41.970">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.270" end="02:18.330"><span begin="01:50.270" end="01:52.820">Don't </span><span begin="01:52.820" end="01:55.370">you </span><span begin="01:55.370" end="01:57.920"> </span><span begin="01:57.920" end="02:00.470">want </span><span begin="02:00.470" end="02:03.020"> </span><span begin="02:03.020" end="02:05.570">to </span><span begin="02:05.570" end="02:08.120"> </span><span begin="02:08.120" end="02:10.670">drive </span><span begin="02:10.670" end="02:13.220">into </span><span begin="02:13.220" end="02:15.770">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.330" end="02:22.340"><span begin="02:18.330" end="02:18.570">This </span><span begin="02:18.570" end="02:19.200">time </span><span begin="02:19.200" end="02:19.230">I </span><span begin="02:19.230" end="02:19.800">was </span><span begin="02:19.800" end="02:20.350">still </span><span begin="02:20.350" end="02:22.190">in </span><span begin="02:22.190" end="02:22.220"> </span><span begin="02:22.220" end="02:22.310">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.340" end="02:25.960"><span begin="02:22.340" end="02:22.630">I </span><span begin="02:22.630" end="02:23.230">know </span><span begin="02:23.230" end="02:23.540">your </span><span begin="02:23.540" end="02:24.060">heart </span><span begin="02:24.060" end="02:24.280">is </span><span begin="02:24.280" end="02:25.900">thirsty</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.960" end="03:14.020"><span begin="02:25.960" end="02:26.440">So </span><span begin="02:26.440" end="02:26.630"> </span><span begin="02:26.630" end="02:27.380">find </span><span begin="02:27.380" end="02:27.640">some </span><span begin="02:27.640" end="02:28.140">flowers </span><span begin="02:28.140" end="02:28.580">still </span><span begin="02:28.580" end="02:30.750">in </span><span begin="02:30.750" end="02:50.070"> </span><span begin="02:50.070" end="02:50.160">here</span></p></div></body></tt>